selection_criteria_en:
• the scientific background of the student, doctoral candidate, researcher, the team and/or the applicant scientific laboratory;
• the scientific quality of the submitted project (requirements, innovation, etc.);
• the relevance of the scientific approach of the submitted project;
• the consistency between the project and the means implemented for its realization.

selection_criteria:
The selection of candidates will be based on the following criteria:
a)   Nota de candidatura ao ensino superior;
b)   Notas dos exames nacionais às disciplinas específicas do curso em que o candidato se encontra inscrito;
c)   Rendimento anual per capita do agregado familiar igual ou inferior a 14.000€.

